From 0079f524f444725d997a65e965c11d715c02099e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Prabhu Sundararaj <prabhu.sundararaj@nxp.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 21:38:59 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] MGS-9060 [#mali] fix swapchainMaintenance1 incorrectly
 reported as unsupported

When VK_KHR_display is enabled alongside a supported surface extension
(e.g. VK_KHR_wayland_surface), set_swapchain_maintenance1_state()
unconditionally sets swapchainMaintenance1 to false because display
WSI does not support it. This causes CTS failures:
- dEQP-VK.info.device_mandatory_features reports swapchainMaintenance1
  as not supported, violating the spec requirement that the feature
  must be VK_TRUE when VK_KHR_swapchain_maintenance1 is advertised.
- dEQP-VK.api.device_init.create_device_unsupported_features.
  swapchain_maintenance1_features_khr fails because driver does not
  reject enabling an unsupported feature.

vulkaninfo enables both VK_KHR_display and VK_KHR_wayland_surface as
instance extensions. The original code disables swapchainMaintenance1
whenever VK_KHR_display is present, even if a supported surface
(wayland/headless) is also enabled.

Fix: Only disable swapchainMaintenance1 when VK_KHR_display is the
only surface type enabled, allowing wayland and headless paths to
correctly report the feature as supported.

Upstream-Status: Pending

Signed-off-by: Prabhu Sundararaj <prabhu.sundararaj@nxp.com>
---
 wsi/wsi_factory.cpp | 7 +++++--
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/wsi/wsi_factory.cpp b/wsi/wsi_factory.cpp
index f281b8a..f33362e 100644
--- a/wsi/wsi_factory.cpp
+++ b/wsi/wsi_factory.cpp
@@ -294,9 +294,12 @@ void set_swapchain_maintenance1_state(VkPhysicalDevice physicalDevice,
    if (swapchain_maintenance1_features != nullptr)
    {
       auto &instance = layer::instance_private_data::get(physicalDevice);
-      if (instance.is_instance_extension_enabled(VK_KHR_DISPLAY_EXTENSION_NAME))
+      if (instance.is_instance_extension_enabled(VK_KHR_DISPLAY_EXTENSION_NAME) &&
+          !instance.is_instance_extension_enabled("VK_KHR_wayland_surface") &&
+          !instance.is_instance_extension_enabled("VK_EXT_headless_surface"))
       {
-         /* Display WSI does not support swapchain maintenance1. */
+         /* Display WSI does not support swapchain maintenance1, but only
+          * disable it when display is the only surface type enabled. */
          swapchain_maintenance1_features->swapchainMaintenance1 = false;
          return;
       }
